---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icons from '../components/Icons.astro';
import { CONFIG } from '../lib/config';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — StreakGrid"
  description="Terms of Service, eligibility criteria, and accountability deposit rules for StreakGrid."
>
  <div class="legal-page-layout">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <div class="legal-header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="brand-link">
          <div class="brand-badge">✓</div>
          <span class="brand-name">StreakGrid</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Return Home</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="legal-content-container">
      <div class="legal-doc-card">
        <div class="doc-header">
          <span class="doc-tag">Legal & Compliance</span>
          <h1 class="doc-title">Terms of Service & Staking Agreement</h1>
          <span class="doc-date">Effective Date: September 2026</span>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-body">
          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>1. Platform Purpose & Positioning</h2>
            <p>
              StreakGrid is a productivity and personal accountability platform designed to assist individuals in achieving long-term consistency through daily challenge tracking. StreakGrid is <strong>not</strong> an investment vehicle, gambling platform, casino, contest, or prize pool.
            </p>
            <p>
              Users do not generate returns or profits on accountability deposits. The sole economic mechanism for Stake Challenges is:
              <em>«Put a refundable accountability deposit on the line. Complete the challenge according to its locked rules. Receive your stake back.»</em>
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>2. Eligibility & Age Requirements</h2>
            <p>
              To create an account and participate in Free Challenges, you must be at least 13 years old (or the applicable age in your jurisdiction).
            </p>
            <p>
              To create or participate in a <strong>Stake Challenge</strong> involving monetary accountability deposits, you must:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Be at least <strong>{CONFIG.minAgeRequirement} years old</strong> or the age of legal majority in your jurisdiction.</li>
              <li>Reside in a supported jurisdiction where accountability deposit systems are legally permissible.</li>
              <li>Use a payment instrument legally issued in your name.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>3. Commitment Lock & Non-Modifiability</h2>
            <p>
              Once a Stake Challenge is paid and activated:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>The challenge cannot be deleted during its active duration.</li>
              <li>Duration and deadline cannot be shifted backwards.</li>
              <li>Daily success criteria cannot be softened or modified.</li>
              <li>Stake amounts cannot be altered or prematurely withdrawn.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              This commitment lock exists to preserve the psychological weight and integrity of your self-selected goal.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>4. Settlement & Refund Process</h2>
            <p>
              When a challenge reaches its conclusion:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <strong>Success:</strong> If you satisfy the locked criteria (e.g. required consistency percentage and applicable proof), your accountability deposit is returned in full via the payment method used.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Failure:</strong> If you do not meet the locked criteria before the deadline, your deposit is forfeited according to the published rules and platform agreement.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>5. Responsible Use</h2>
            <p>
              Stake amounts must reflect meaningful personal accountability, not excessive financial risk. You agree not to deposit funds that would impact your basic living necessities, health, or financial solvency.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>6. Dispute Resolution</h2>
            <p>
              If a technical discrepancy or unfair failure occurs, you may file a formal dispute within {CONFIG.disputeWindowDays} days of challenge completion. Administrative decisions are logged immutably and resolved in accordance with published terms.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page-layout {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .legal-header {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 12px 20px;
  }

  .legal-header-inner {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .brand-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .brand-badge {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    border-radius: 5px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .legal-content-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 30px auto 80px auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .legal-doc-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-modal);
    padding: 40px 36px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .doc-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .doc-tag {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary-hover);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .doc-title {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .doc-date {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .doc-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .doc-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .doc-section h2 {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .doc-section ul {
    margin-left: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .doc-section li strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>
